'''Carrolyn''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{zone|Scarleton}}. The player can give them {{Green|3,000}} of certain items to gain {{Stat|Crop Fortune|+12}} for the matching crop, {{Stat|Health|+5}}, and {{SBXP|+5}} each.

